From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amaan Qureshi <git@amaanq.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/14] octeon: import the Cavium cvmx register headers for CN73xx

The cvmx register headers for the CN73xx octeon. They cover the BGX, PKI,
PKO3, FPA3, SSO, GSER and QLM blocks that mainline has no support for. They
are auto generated CSR definitions, which is why the file is large.

Signed-off-by: Amaan Qureshi <git@amaanq.com>
