+/**
+ * cvmx_l2c_ecc_ctl
+ *
+ * Flip ECC bits to generate single-bit or double-bit ECC errors in all instances of a given
+ * memory type. Encodings are as follows.
+ * 0x0 = No error.
+ * 0x1 = Single-bit error on ECC<0>.
+ * 0x2 = Single-bit error on ECC<1>.
